@startuml SafeRoute_Arkitektur
scale 1.3
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam ArrowFontColor #444444
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam rectangle<<person>> {
  BackgroundColor #08427B
  FontColor white
  FontSize 14
  RoundCorner 20
}
skinparam rectangle<<container>> {
  BackgroundColor #1168BD
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 14
  RoundCorner 16
}
skinparam rectangle<<planned>> {
  BackgroundColor #6E9FC7
  FontColor white
  FontStyle italic
  FontSize 13
  RoundCorner 16
}
skinparam rectangle<<data>> {
  BackgroundColor #2E6E3E
  FontColor white
  FontSize 13
  RoundCorner 16
}
skinparam rectangle<<external>> {
  BackgroundColor #8C8C8C
  FontColor white
  FontSize 13
  RoundCorner 16
}

title Arkitektur (container-diagram): SafeRoute

rectangle "**Bruger**" <<person>> as Bruger

package "SafeRoute [systemgrænse]" {
  rectangle "**Mobile Client**\n[React Native / Expo]\n\nKort, rutevalg,\nindrapportering,\nlokal geofence-evaluering" <<container>> as Mobile
  rectangle "**Backend API**\n[FastAPI]\n\nREST + WebSocket.\nRuter, zoner, hændelser,\nrapporter, auth, crime index" <<container>> as Backend
  rectangle "**Async Worker**\n[skala-afhængig, se 4.4]\n\nGenberegner segment-\nscores, henter nyheder\nperiodisk og event-udløst" <<planned>> as Worker
  rectangle "**Datalag**\n[PostgreSQL + PostGIS]\n\nIncidents, SegmentScores,\nReports, Users" <<data>> as Data
}

rectangle "**OS-notifikationstjeneste**\n[Expo/Apple/Google]" <<external>> as Push
rectangle "**OSRM**\n[Rutemotor]" <<external>> as OSRM
rectangle "**Offentlige datakilder**\n[Danmarks Statistik m.fl.]" <<external>> as OpenData
rectangle "**Nyhedskilder**\n[RSS/API]" <<external>> as News

' Fastlåst venstre-til-højre rækkefølge, så layoutet ikke krydser sig selv
Mobile -[hidden]right- Backend
Backend -[hidden]right- Worker
Push -[hidden]right- OSRM
OSRM -[hidden]right- OpenData
OpenData -[hidden]right- News

Bruger -down-> Mobile : bruger

Mobile <-right-> Backend : REST/WebSocket\n(ruter, zoner, rapporter, scorer)

Backend .right.> Worker : Enqueuer\nopgaver (async)

Backend -down-> Data : Læser/skriver
Worker -down-> Data : Opdaterer\nsegment-scores

Mobile -down-> Push : Planlægger lokal\nnotifikation
Backend -up-> OSRM : Forespørger ruter\n(REST)
Worker -down-> OpenData : Henter periodisk
Worker -down-> News : Henter periodisk

@enduml
